    "body": "Closes #51.\n\nFixes the arguments passed to the github-backup tool. The previous version used flags that do not exist in the tool (--user, --include).\n\n## Correct usage\n- HoneyBeeOne as positional argument\n- -O for organization\n- -t $TOKEN for authentication\n- -o $DIR for output directory\n- -R honeybee-browser for the repository\n- --issues --pulls --labels --milestones as separate flags\n\n## Verified locally\nRan the same command with a Personal Access Token on the maintainer's machine: 30 issues, 19 PRs (including fork PRs), 11 labels.",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-22T18:38:29Z",
